1. Heat the food in the microwave.
   ```lisp
   (:goal (and (heated food)))
   ```

2. Move the heated food to the living room desk.
   ```lisp
   (:goal (and (item_on food desk)))
   ```

3. Place the water bottle from the kitchen onto the desk in the living room.
   ```lisp
   (:goal (and (item_on water_bottle desk)))
   ```

4. Store the eggs in the egg container in the kitchen.
   ```lisp
   (:goal (and (item_in_container eggs egg_container)))
   ```